{"title": "Ancient Temple", "pageid": 13435, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Ancient_Temple", "categories": ["Locations", "Act One Locations"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Screen_Forgotten_Temple_West_from_Abandoned_Refuge.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Screen_Forgotten_Temple_West_from_Abandoned_Refuge.jpg/300px-Screen_Forgotten_Temple_West_from_Abandoned_Refuge.jpg.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Screen_Forgotten_Temple_West_from_Abandoned_Refuge.jpg/450px-Screen_Forgotten_Temple_West_from_Abandoned_Refuge.jpg.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a8/Screen_Forgotten_Temple_West_from_Abandoned_Refuge.jpg/600px-Screen_Forgotten_Temple_West_from_Abandoned_Refuge.jpg.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a8/Screen_Forgotten_Temple_West_from_Abandoned_Refuge.jpg/300px-Screen_Forgotten_Temple_West_from_Abandoned_Refuge.jpg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a8/Screen_Forgotten_Temple_West_from_Abandoned_Refuge.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption><div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">  The view, looking West, upon entering the <b>Ancient Temple</b> area from <a href=\"/wiki/Abandoned_Refuge\" title=\"Abandoned Refuge\">Abandoned Refuge</a>  </div></figcaption></figure>The <b>Ancient Temple</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Location\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Location\">Location</a> within <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Baldur%27s_Gate_3\" title=\"Baldur's Gate 3\">Baldur's Gate 3</a>. A location discoverable in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>, but without immediate access beyond some overlooking cliffs. \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>This is the <a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlet_of_Shar\" title=\"Gauntlet of Shar\">Gauntlet of Shar</a>, which can be reached only after travelling to the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Lands\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Lands\">Shadow-Cursed Lands</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Act_Two\" title=\"Act Two\">Act Two</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Related_Locations\">Related Locations</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abandoned_Refuge\" title=\"Abandoned Refuge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Abandoned Refuge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Abandoned_Refuge\" title=\"Abandoned Refuge\">Abandoned Refuge</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/38px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/50px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Grymforge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png/25px-Custom_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/02/Custom_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=